# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:4
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_35a648d8:

    # "Upon meeting with the Traders convoy, we set out along the arduous journey, traveling along the outskirts of the Valley of death along the dirt roads before we planned to plunge through the shortest path of the desert."
    "交易商人の隊商と合流すると、我々は過酷な旅路へと向かった。まずは死の谷の外縁を未舗装の道に沿って進み、その後、最短ルートで砂漠へと突き進む計画だった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:5
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_62b15935:

    # "We stopped at the few fortress inns that we could when the land became dark, but the Traders were keen at the first break of light to keep us moving through the valley as quickly as possible."
    "土地が暗くなると、私たちは数少ない砦の宿で立ち寄ったが、商人たちは夜明けとともに、できるだけ早く谷を進むよう私たちを急がせた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:9
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_218561a8:

    # "Along the way, the convoy was suddenly halted by a woman stood in the middle of the road holding what seemed to be a baby cradled in her one arm as she did her best to wave us down."
    "途中、一行は突然、道の真ん中に立った女性に遮られた。彼女は片腕に赤ん坊らしきものを抱え、必死に我々を止めようと手を振っていた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:11
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_c42b1fe3:

    # "As the caravan slowed down though, she tossed the bundle of rags aside, revealing a crossbow beneath that she fired straight towards one of the coachmen, piercing him straight through the eye as he slumped over dead."
    "しかし隊商の速度が緩むと同時に、彼女はぼろ布の束を投げ捨て、その下に隠していた十字弓をいきなり馬車の御者の一人に向けて放ち、その矢が目を貫通して、御者がずっしりと倒れ伏した。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:13
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_20ed9734:

    # "Panic and screams arose all around as the horses with the dead coachmen rose up onto their hind legs and bolted, sending the caravan hurdling off-course and crashing it against a rock before they fled across the fields."
    "死んだ御者の馬たちが後ろ脚で立ち上がり、駆け出すと、周囲には恐慌と悲鳴が湧き起こった。隊商は進路から外れ、岩に突っ込むようにして大破し、馬たちは野原を駆け去っていった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:15
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_ad68b1f7:

    # CARAVAN_MASTER "BANDITS!"
    CARAVAN_MASTER "山賊!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:31
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_39677cf0:

    # "A hurl of arrows hit into the sides of some of the caravans as frantically people reached to grab whatever weapons they could to defend themselves."
    "矢の雨が襲いかかり、数台の馬車の側面にバシッと突き刺さった。人々は慌てて何かしらの武器を手に取ろうとし、身を守る態勢を整えた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:32
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_f93f4ea0:

    # "I drew my blade as I heard a resolute cry:"
    "断固たる叫び声が聞こえたと同時に、私は剣を抜き放った。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:34
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_e5da16a2:

    # CARAVAN_MASTER "PROTECT THE CARAVAN!"
    CARAVAN_MASTER "キャラバンを守れ!"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:37
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_e4503af9:

    # "After slicing down another one of the bandits with my blade, a loud horn was sounded as the remaining bandits fled, dragging their wounded with them."
    "剣で又一人の山賊を切り伏せると、残った賊は轟音の角笛を合図に、傷ついた仲間を引きずりながら逃走していった。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:38
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_52ab2d89:

    # "The Caravan wasted no time, quickly hurried away from the scene before the bandits could try again, horses bolting as fast as they could along the road."
    "隊商は一刻も早く、賊が再度の襲撃を試みる前に現場から急いで離れ、馬は道に沿って全力で駆け出した。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:41
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_19cff723:

    # "Eventually, after a few more hours travel, we arrived at the outskirts of Hamun safely at last."
    "やがて、さらに数時間の旅を経て、ようやく無事ハムンの外れに到着した。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:42
translate ja qst_guild_caravan_7f8247f5:

    # "The traders thanked me for my protection, and I was rewarded there and then with payment."
    "商人たちは私の護衛にお礼を言い、その場で報酬として支払われた。"

# game/data/world_quests/guild_board/Caravan/scr.rpy:44
